          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy the Toro TimeCutter MyRIDE 42 for one to two acres: suspension, a fabricated deck and stronger transmissions in a size that fits most gates. Save money with the Husqvarna Z242F Special Edition if your lot is smooth, move up to the Husqvarna Z254FX for two to four acres, and choose the Ariens Zenith 60 only if your ground is large and rough.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
